[00:00.82]Gracious Jehovah, we praise you and thank you.
[00:08.92]Father, we make these expressions in prayer.
[00:17.58]Trusting in you, we will serve you completely,
[00:25.30]Knowing we thrive under your tender care.
[00:34.50]Daily our errors reveal imperfection.
[00:42.08]For our transgressions forgiveness we seek.
[00:52.69]Thankful we are that our lives have been ransomed.
[01:00.47]Thankful we are that you know we are weak.
[01:10.30]Grateful we are that you show love and kindness.
[01:17.98]Thank you for drawing us closer to you.
[01:25.92]Teach us to know you, and help us to serve you.
[01:33.62]Show us the way to be loyal and true.
[01:42.32]Thankful we are for your powerful spirit.
[01:49.98]Grateful we are for the courage to speak.
[02:00.32]May we be humble and happy to serve you;
[02:08.08]May we give thanks, for you favor the meek.
